# Board + move join (no summarizing)

Policy scoring must see the **full pitch CNN map** (flattened) and the **full
legal-row encoding**. Do not ship GAP-only, attention-pooled, or endpoint-only
joins as the policy’s board view.

## Required

```
pitch CNN → map (N, C, H, W) → flatten
non-pitch (benches / scalars / …) kept as-is
row_emb = encode_legal_rows(full pack)
row_scorer([ flatten(map) ‖ non_pitch ‖ row_emb ])
```

Value head may still GAP the pitch into the SB3 `features_dim` vector — that is
for the critic / stock extractor contract, **not** a substitute for the join.

## Forbidden

- Defending “GAP / attn / gather is enough” when the ask is full board + move
- Adding spatial summaries on the policy path without an explicit product reason

See [`ai/PPO_STRATEGY.md`](ai/PPO_STRATEGY.md) (stock vs deviations).
